(6975972, 1051667, 140537, '<td valign="top">Your challenge is to show us one (simple pleasure), to make us smile and say "Yeah, I''d like THAT!<br/>I don''t know how owning a pony is a simple pleasure. And no one is hugging it. I wouldn''t say DNMC, but IMO a bit of a shoehorn. <br/>With that said, lovely image. Crisp, but with shallow DOF. Well cropped. And very cute.</td>', 'Your challenge is to show us one (simple pleasure), to make us smile and say "Yeah, I''d like THAT!I don''t know how owning a pony is a simple pleasure. And no one is hugging it. I wouldn''t say DNMC, but IMO a bit of a shoehorn. With that said, lovely image. Crisp, but with shallow DOF. Well cropped. And very cute.', '2013-02-09 08:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
