(6977064, 1052529, 119419, '<td valign="top">Hmm I was going for that 60''s film still shot feel, you know, the one with Gina Lollobrigida wearing a scarf with the dark sunnies on a mountainside in Monte Carlo. This is Billie, one of the people in my dog walking group. She has a guide dog in training (Gareth is centre frame being patted by the other girl. Billy is effervescent 12 year old and is wearing her panda suit. We normally have about 6 to 8 adults and dogs, always eventful. The scene looks like a backdrop but is a large reserve and it is all one shot.</td>', 'Hmm I was going for that 60''s film still shot feel, you know, the one with Gina Lollobrigida wearing a scarf with the dark sunnies on a mountainside in Monte Carlo. This is Billie, one of the people in my dog walking group. She has a guide dog in training (Gareth is centre frame being patted by the other girl. Billy is effervescent 12 year old and is wearing her panda suit. We normally have about 6 to 8 adults and dogs, always eventful. The scene looks like a backdrop but is a large reserve and it is all one shot.', '2013-02-11 06:42:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6977066, 1051772, 59029, '<td valign="top">Great work!  Grats on the blue :-)</td>', 'Great work!  Grats on the blue :-)', '2013-02-11 07:03:32.000000', NULL, 0),
